<section class="content-slide">
  <span class="eyebrow">Per-Engineer View</span>
  <h3>Contributions by Engineer · After Period</h3>
  <pre class="mermaid">
xychart-beta
    title "{{METRIC_LABEL}}"
    x-axis {{ENG_LABELS}}
    y-axis "Contribution"
    bar {{ENG_VALUES}}
  </pre>
  <p class="diagram-legend"><i data-lucide="info"></i> Per AAP §0.8.1, Blitzy Agent appears as one row in the after period. Real names use the resolved aliases in actor_aliases.json.</p>
